#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed (config + systemd)"
msgstr "托管（配置 + systemd）"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare a process in `~/.anima/config.yaml`. `anima service start/stop/restart` writes `anima-satellite-<name>.service` user units (when systemd is available) and starts/stops them with `anima.service`.\n"
msgstr "在 `~/.anima/config.yaml` 中声明进程。`anima service start/stop/restart` 会写入 `anima-satellite-<name>.service` 用户单元（在 systemd 可用时），并与 `anima.service` 一并启动/停止。\n"

