#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:40
msgid ""
"Working directory is derived by anima from the install layout (monorepo root "
"or CLI package root), not configured here."
msgstr ""
"工作目录由 anima 根据安装布局（monorepo 根目录或 CLI 包根目录）推导，不在此处"
"配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup:** managed satellites start only after Hub `GET /api/health` returns `status: ok`.\n"
msgstr "**启动：** 托管卫星仅在 Hub `GET /api/health` 返回 `status: ok` 之后才会启动。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:44
msgid ""
"See [service.md](../guide/service.md) for systemd unit paths and startup "
"order."
msgstr ""
"有关 systemd 单元路径与启动顺序，见 [service.md](../guide/service.md)。"

