#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:187
msgid ""
"Per [`.agent/rules/code-layers.md`](../../.agent/rules/code-layers.md) "
"(Dependency allow/deny matrix): `satellites/*` may depend only on "
"`@freeanima/sap-contract`, `@freeanima/kernel`, and `kernel-*` packages. Do "
"not import `platform`, `runtime`, `core`, or `capabilities-*` from Satellite "
"code."
