"依据 [`.agent/rules/code-layers.md`](../../.agent/rules/code-layers.md)（依赖"
"允许/禁止矩阵）：`satellites/*` 只能依赖 `@freeanima/sap-contract`、"
"`@freeanima/kernel` 及 `kernel-*` 包。请勿在 Satellite 代码中导入 "
"`platform`、`runtime`、`core` 或 `capabilities-*`。"

